config CASCADIA_ACCESSORY_ROLE_RESEARCH
 bool "Cascadia offline-reviewed accessory role transport component"
 depends on ARCH_APPLE_S5L && USB_GADGET
 default n
 help
   Builds only a USB setup-request decoder with a deny-by-default policy.
   It registers no gadget function, role switch, PHY or power provider.
   Enabling this option alone cannot switch the connector or power VBUS.
